---
const controls = [
  ['Signed service calls','Caller, audience, timestamp, nonce, scope, and body are verified.'],
  ['Least-privilege ownership','Each runtime service writes only its own tables through a distinct database role.'],
  ['Independent delivery','Discord, Telegram, and email attempts retry independently after report persistence.'],
  ['Measurable quality','Reviews track correct, partial, incorrect, and unknown outcomes, including false confidence.'],
];
---
<section id="trust" class="trust-section" aria-labelledby="trust-title">
  <div class="shell trust-layout">
    <header class="section-heading reveal-item"><p class="eyebrow">Trust is a system property</p><h2 id="trust-title">Safe when requests repeat.<br/>Honest when evidence stops.</h2><p>Application contracts enforce authentication, replay protection, idempotency, bounded egress, and durable recovery.</p></header>
    <div class="control-list">{controls.map(([title,body], index) => <article class="reveal-item" style={`--reveal-delay:${index * 60}ms`}><span>0{index+1}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{body}</p></div></article>)}</div>
  </div>
</section>
<section id="quick-start" class="closing-section" aria-labelledby="closing-title">
  <div class="shell closing-layout">
    <div class="closing-copy reveal-item"><p class="eyebrow">Open source · MIT</p><h2 id="closing-title">Inspect the contracts.<br/>Run the stack.</h2><p class="closing-tagline">For infrastructure teams who would rather sleep than chase alerts.</p><p>Pamawas is built in public across focused services. The normative system design defines the target; tests decide whether the code is compliant.</p><div class="closing-actions"><a class="button button-primary" href="https://github.com/Pamawas" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Browse Pamawas <span>↗</span></a><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/Pamawas/pamawas.github.io" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Landing source ↗</a></div></div>
    <div class="quick-command reveal-item"><header><span>Local development</span><button id="copy-code-btn" type="button" aria-label="Copy quick start command">Copy</button></header><pre id="quickstart-code"><code><b>git clone</b> https://github.com/Pamawas/pamawas-infra.git
<b>cd</b> pamawas-infra/docker-compose
<b>cp</b> .env.example .env
<span># configure local keys in .env</span>
<b>docker compose</b> up -d</code></pre><footer>Development stack · review configuration first</footer><p id="copy-status" class="sr-only" aria-live="polite"></p></div>
  </div>
</section>
